 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#what-is-an-ai-visibility-content-gap-and-how-is-it-different-from-seo-gaps"&gt;What is an AI visibility content gap and how is it different from SEO gaps?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#how-to-identify-content-gaps-for-ai-visibility-step-by-step"&gt;How to Identify Content Gaps for AI Visibility Step-by-Step&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#how-to-analyze-ai-and-search-results-to-understand-what-to-fix"&gt;How to Analyze AI and Search Results to Understand What to Fix&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#how-to-create-or-update-content-to-close-ai-visibility-gaps"&gt;How to Create or Update Content to Close AI Visibility Gaps&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
